Both hypotheses survive:
- box/status: confidence 95, class MISCONFIG (not rejected), concrete verify_steps → KEEP
- box CORS/CSP: confidence 55, class MISCONFIG (not rejected), concrete verify_steps → KEEP

[PARKED] Cross-tenant security-token minting via X-Auth org UID override: AUTH_HELPED test requires `sos login` + two orgs; current phase is box POC, api target is off-phase for this cycle.

[FINAL] Ranked surviving hypotheses:
1. [95] box.signageos.io/status — unauthenticated K8s topology leak behind CloudFront with zero hardening headers
2. [55] box.signageos.io — CORS static whitelist + wildcard expands trust boundary (no creds flag → MISCONFIG only)

